{
  "id": "d1-plumbing",
  "description": "Recorded tool-call script for demonstration D1 (drill bit holder), replayed by the FAKE provider. Plumbing test only: it proves the operations, previews, Apply and persistence work end to end; it is not a model run and does not count as D1 acceptance. Steps whose operations do not exist yet are listed in tests/e2e/flows/demo-d1.mjs.",
  "turns": [
    {
      "user": "^D1 concept:",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.create",
              "arguments": {
                "text": "Drill bit holder block for a Milwaukee-compatible cordless drill (compatibility description only). It holds 6 hex-shank bits with a 1/4 in hex shank of 6.35 mm and mounts to the drill's accessory interface. Assume the accessory interface uses two holes 25 mm apart; this spacing is an assumption, not a measurement. Should the bits be retained by friction or by magnets?"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared a Concept from your need statement (kept verbatim). Origins: the bit count and hex size are user constraints; the mounting-hole spacing is an assumption; the retention question stays open because it changes the pocket design. Apply the card to create it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 functions and constraints",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.search",
              "arguments": {
                "text": "Drill bit holder block"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.create_function",
              "arguments": {
                "name": "Hold the bits",
                "performedBy": [
                  "${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.create_constraint",
              "arguments": {
                "subjectId": "${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}",
                "statement": "Hex pocket width across flats, derived from the 6.35 mm hex shank plus 0.15 mm clearance",
                "operator": ">=",
                "value": 6.5,
                "unit": "mm",
                "kind": "dimensional"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.create_constraint",
              "arguments": {
                "subjectId": "${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}",
                "statement": "Wall thickness between pockets (AI-proposed)",
                "operator": ">=",
                "value": 1.5,
                "unit": "mm",
                "kind": "dimensional",
                "strength": "soft"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.record_assumption",
              "arguments": {
                "statement": "Accessory interface hole spacing of 25 mm (assumed, not measured)",
                "subjectId": "${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}",
                "value": 25,
                "unit": "mm"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared a function, two constraints and one assumption for ${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}. The pocket width is derived (6.35 mm plus 0.15 mm clearance); the wall thickness is AI-proposed; the hole spacing is an assumption. Apply each card."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 requirements",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.search",
              "arguments": {
                "text": "Drill bit holder block"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.propose_requirement",
              "arguments": {
                "conceptId": "${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared draft requirements from the quantified constraints of ${conceptualize.search.data.concepts.0.key}, linked with “proposes”. They are drafts; approval stays in Requirements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 alternatives",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "conceptualize.develop_alternatives",
              "arguments": {
                "text": "Bit holder block: compare pocket layouts for six bits",
                "count": 2
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared two alternative layouts as AI hypotheses for comparison. Recording a decision on them needs named alternatives (pending)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 CAD",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "cad-modeler.run_commands",
              "arguments": {
                "label": "Holder block 60 x 20 x 15 mm with one bit pocket (stand-in for hex pockets)",
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "command": "create_part",
                    "input": {
                      "name": "Bit holder block",
                      "ref": "$p"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "create_parameter",
                    "input": {
                      "partId": "$p",
                      "name": "length",
                      "expression": "60"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "create_parameter",
                    "input": {
                      "partId": "$p",
                      "name": "width",
                      "expression": "20"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "create_parameter",
                    "input": {
                      "partId": "$p",
                      "name": "height",
                      "expression": "15"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "create_sketch",
                    "input": {
                      "partId": "$p",
                      "plane": "XY",
                      "name": "Base sketch",
                      "ref": "$s"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "add_rectangle",
                    "input": {
                      "sketchId": "$s",
                      "width": "length",
                      "height": "width",
                      "ref": "$r"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "extrude_profile",
                    "input": {
                      "sketchId": "$s",
                      "distance": "height",
                      "name": "Base",
                      "ref": "$e"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "create_sketch",
                    "input": {
                      "partId": "$p",
                      "plane": "XY",
                      "name": "Pocket sketch",
                      "ref": "$h"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "add_circle",
                    "input": {
                      "sketchId": "$h",
                      "center": [
                        10,
                        10
                      ],
                      "radius": 3.75,
                      "ref": "$c"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "command": "extrude_profile",
                    "input": {
                      "sketchId": "$h",
                      "distance": "height",
                      "operation": "cut",
                      "name": "Pocket",
                      "ref": "$x"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared the block as native CAD commands. The hex pocket, the linear pattern and parameter bindings to the constraints are pending CAD commands; the round pocket is a labelled stand-in. Apply to build it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 save",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "cad-modeler.save_document",
              "arguments": {
                "message": "D1 plumbing: holder block"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared saving the CAD document to the project (a new immutable revision in the CAD service)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "user": "^D1 export",
      "steps": [
        {
          "calls": [
            {
              "name": "cad-modeler.export",
              "arguments": {
                "format": "step"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "final": "I prepared a STEP export of the active document (geometry only; the native model keeps the feature history)."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
